SORCERER-BLOODLINES BLOODLINES BLOODLINE

Sorcerers choose one bloodline in study. Benefits are shown before confirmation.
Arcane, Draconic and Elemental offer heritage suboptions. Dragon Disciples
must choose Draconic. There are ten bloodlines in total.

Bloodline use limits now recover per five real minutes. Each full pool resets
five minutes after its first use, without extending the timer on retries.
Conviction instead recovers every 30 seconds and can select attack, save,
skill or any eligible roll. Stored cooldowns survive logout.

Shadow Well grants concealment to yourself or a grouped ally in darkness.
Destined rerolls and spell penetration now trigger passively. Type bloodline
for the six new bloodlines' powers and remaining uses; use feat info <power>
for exact rules. Original bloodlines retain their command families.

The six new bloodlines grant bonus spells at sorcerer levels 3, 5, 7, 9, 11,
13, 15, 17 and 19. These consume normal slots without Study spell selections.

See also: SHADOW-BLOODLINE, STORMBORN-BLOODLINE, DESTINED-BLOODLINE,
ABYSSAL-BLOODLINE, ELEMENTAL-BLOODLINE, CELESTIAL-BLOODLINE, STUDY
